      "ArticleTitle": "Antinociception induced by 3-((+-)-2-carboxypiperazin-4-yl)-propyl-1- phosphonic acid (CPP), an N-methyl-D-aspartate (NMDA) competitive antagonist, plus 6,7-dinitroquinoxaline-2,3-dione (DNQX), a non-NMDA antagonist, differs from that induced by MK-801 plus DNQX.",
